1
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:07,240
(Penny:)One, two,

2
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:09,780
(Penny:)three, four, five.

3
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:10,630
(Penny:)No way.

4
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:11,610
(Howard:)That's your card, right?

5
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,110
(Penny:)Seven of clubs!

6
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:14,480
(Penny:)That is amazing!

7
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,820
(Sheldon:)It's not amazing.

8
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:21,460
(Sheldon:)All magic tricks are merely
a combination

9
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,160
(Sheldon:)of manipulation
and misdirection

10
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:27,790
(Sheldon:)with the occasional dwarf in
a box wiggling his feet.

11
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,760
(Howard:)Oh, really?
So how did I do it?

12
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:32,370
(Sheldon:)I don't care how you did it.

13
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:36,140
(Sheldon:)I have more important things
to think about.

14
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:43,010
(Sheldon:)Clearly, the cards
are marked.

15
00:00:43,010 --> 00:00:45,380
(Howard:)I thought you had more important
things to think about.

16
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,150
(Howard:)I do.
You just happened

17
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:49,050
(Sheldon:)to have caught me
on a break.

18
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:53,790
(Sheldon:)Oh, let me see
those cards.

19
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:55,120
(Penny:)Big deal. Not knowing

20
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:56,660
(Penny:)is part of the fun.

21
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,530
"Not knowing is part
of the fun."

22
00:00:58,530 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)Was that the motto
of your community college?

